kxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDI2NjcxMDUwNjk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/events/2667105069","actor":{"login":"blueyed","id":9766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3NjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueyed","html_url":"https://github.com/blueyed","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueyed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueyed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueyed/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueyed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueyed/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueyed/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueyed/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueyed/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueyed/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-09-27T01:00:59Z","label":{"name":"bug-regression","color":"f9d0c4"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/535926212","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/11102#issuecomment-535926212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/11102","id":535926212,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzNTkyNjIxMg==","user":{"login":"deathlyfrantic","id":7629614,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2Mjk2MTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7629614?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deathlyfrantic","html_url":"https://github.com/deathlyfrantic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deathlyfrantic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deathlyfrantic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deathlyfrantic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deathlyfrantic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deathlyfrantic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deathlyfrantic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deathlyfrantic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deathlyfrantic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deathlyfrantic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-27T12:52:34Z","updated_at":"2019-09-27T12:52:34Z","body":"I tried to trace the Peekaboo code to see if I could figure out what series of steps is causing this. Unfortunately I was not able to pinpoint it exactly, but it seems the general cause is the Peekaboo window is getting closed unintentionally.\r\n\r\nIn Vim, if I have my example with \"something\" selected in visual mode, and I type `\"0`, the Peekaboo window is open with the `0` register line highlighted. In Neovim, after the same series of steps the Peekaboo window is not open.\r\n\r\nPeekaboo [sets up a `CursorMoved` autocmd](https://github.com/junegunn/vim-peekaboo/blob/master/autoload/peekaboo.vim#L99) to delete its buffer if the cursor is moved; I added an `echomsg` to this and saw this being fired in the middle of the sequence when it didn't seem (to me) like it should be.\r\n\r\nThis series of steps reproduces a weird situation that _might_ be the cause:\r\n```\r\nnvim -u NONE\r\n:wincmd v\r\n:autocmd CursorMoved <buffer> echoerr 'moved'\r\n:wincmd l\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn Neovim, this event fires and I get:\r\n```\r\nError detected while processing CursorMoved Autocommands for \"<buffer=1>\":\r\nmoved\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn Vim, this event does not fire.\r\n\r\nIs the CursorMoved event supposed to fire when switching between windows?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/535926212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":